WEBVTT

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:25.900
Yui! I'm coming in!

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.900
Oh, good morning!

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:30.320
Good morning, Aoi.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.660
So, today we've got--
What's all this?!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.620
What do you mean? It's breakfast.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:42.320
This is quite a big breakfast!
Eat this and you'll get fat.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.870
Hey, Aoi...

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:45.830
What?

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:49.920
Have you seen Rena and the others?
They've been gone all morning.

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:53.630
Rena? Is she a friend of yours?

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:54.840
What...?

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.450
Good morning, Yui!

00:02:44.530 --> 00:02:46.330
Good morning, Retty!

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.210
Um, yesterday--

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:59.010
That reminds me, are Sara
and Tia still at your place?

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:03.390
Oh, I thought they went back to your place.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.930
Jeez! I told them they were
supposed to work this morning!

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.560
So, did something happen yesterday?

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.480
Oh, no, nothing.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:15.690
Oh.

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:22.820
And then I found a total cutie...

00:03:23.030 --> 00:03:23.910
Oh, really?

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.660
Yeah! She had long hair...

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.790
I'm afraid I can't let you in.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.460
Oh, is this entrance closed right now?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.760
No, but the general public can't enter
the castle without special permission.

00:03:43.970 --> 00:03:44.720
Huh?

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:48.390
There are days when it's open to visitors.
Why don't you come back then?

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.270
Oh... okay...

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.100
Thank you.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.460
You usually answer right away, Aoi...

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.360
What's his rush?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.770
Are you okay?

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:39.980
Yeah...

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:43.280
Thank you.

00:04:43.490 --> 00:04:47.870
You should watch where
you're going too, young lady.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:49.370
I'm sorry.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:52.120
Um...

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.420
What is it?

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:58.040
Oh, nothing.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:06.760
Hey! Hang on!

00:05:08.350 --> 00:05:09.970
Wait for me!

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:22.820
Retty!

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:32.330
Hey, Retty...

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:36.210
I'm sorry, but we're closed for the day.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:42.120
Thanks for stopping by.
We'll give you a little treat next time.

00:05:43.510 --> 00:05:44.710
Retty...

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:49.420
Hmm? Retty? My name is Retsu.
Have I met you before?

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.690
It's me, Yui.

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:01.150
Huh?

00:06:01.360 --> 00:06:04.820
You're the only one who has
ever called me Yui at school,

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:07.030
ever since we were little.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:11.740
I wanted to be friends, so I tried
giving you the nickname Retty.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:16.830
And when I did, you smiled,
and you looked so happy.

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:21.540
I'm sorry to say this, but I
think you have the wrong person.

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:32.430
Retty!

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:36.060
I feel... so sleepy...

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:42.020
Retty, are you okay? Retty!

00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:54.360
Yui, was it? I'm sorry to bother
you like this. Thank you...

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.130
Sleep tight, Retty.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:16.320
These are for Rena and you.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:18.280
Me and my big sis?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:21.330
Yui?

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:23.290
What is it, Mother?

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:28.000
These will help guide you two
whenever you're feeling lost or down.

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.010
Guide us?

00:08:31.210 --> 00:08:35.710
That's right! These will remind you
of your promise to work together.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:40.770
Hmm... I don't really get it.

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:45.470
Rena is going to look out for you,
so you've got to look out for her too, okay?

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:49.230
Okay! I promise I will!

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:50.440
That's a good girl!

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:54.820
Can I go give the ring to her?

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:57.160
Sure! Go on, then!

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.620
Here I go!

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:12.210
Mother...

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:17.010
Big sis...

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:28.480
Rena... Sara... Tia... Kei...
Ingrid... I can't give up.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:39.910
They're all fighting against him! I know it!

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:03.180
Sara... Tia...

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.100
Yui!

00:10:06.310 --> 00:10:07.730
It's Yui!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.900
Sara... Tia...

00:10:35.880 --> 00:10:40.380
There's plenty left for a second round,
so eat as much as you want!

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:42.550
Sorry, Yui.

00:10:43.680 --> 00:10:45.680
I'm sorry, Yui.

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:51.190
What happened after I collapsed?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:34.020
Welcome... to Lux Ex Machina.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:39.940
I hope you are pleased with the
VIP seats I've prepared for you.

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.070
No, it can't be...

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:49.280
That's right! Can you believe it?
The seal had already been broken!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.960
I certainly can't...

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:56.040
Huh? Does he mean the thing we sealed up?

00:11:56.250 --> 00:12:00.750
Well, it was easy to bring
Kei back using the resonance...

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:06.760
But that meant breaking
Lux Ex Machina's seal, too.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:08.220
You never...!

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:10.270
Never told you about that?

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:14.350
You think I'd tell you something so important?

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.230
I guess I should be grateful to you, Ingrid.

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:21.940
Thanks to your 12 years of hard work,
my wishes have finally been granted.

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:52.930
Calm down, Ingrid.
That's no normal Regalia Gear.

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:57.640
Have at it. They're nothing like
those pieces of junk I gave to you.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.860
We've got to work with Sara and Tia.

00:13:02.070 --> 00:13:04.650
If we do, we're sure to find a weakness.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:09.200
Plus, it looks like those two have
taken an interest in my dolls.

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.870
I think... It's got to be big sister!

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.290
Big sister?

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.790
Well, it's taken a little while,

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.630
but I think we're about
ready to start the show.

00:13:27.010 --> 00:13:29.510
Lux Ex Machina... It's moving!

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:55.290
An amazing view, is it not?

00:13:55.500 --> 00:14:00.000
The best view for watching the
beginning of the end of the world!

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:18.640
Sara! This is bad!
Everyone's going to disappear again!

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:23.020
I won't make them disappear right away.
That wouldn't be any fun.

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:28.070
Yui!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.780
First of all, I've erased
everyone's memories of you.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.580
Oh, no! The Empress can't get into her castle.

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:38.790
Yui...

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:43.630
Your precious, trusting friends
have forgotten, too.

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:44.550
Retsu...

00:14:44.750 --> 00:14:45.760
Yui...

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:49.130
Look, she's going to cry. Poor thing.

00:14:51.010 --> 00:14:54.850
Aw, she's all alone in the world.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:01.400
I wonder how it feels to lose
everyone that is dear to you.

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:04.110
It must be terribly lonely!

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.320
Johann!

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.280
I won't let you do that to Yui!

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.910
This time, we will send
you back to the void!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.210
Ingrid!

00:15:24.420 --> 00:15:28.130
Kei! Sara, we've got to help them!

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.300
Big sister...

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:51.270
Looks like you're the only one left.
What'll you do?

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:55.740
I'm... I'm going to protect Yui, no matter what!

00:15:57.450 --> 00:16:00.710
Great! That's the spirit.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.340
Magna... Alecto...

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.270
That's no good!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.360
Rena!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.700
S-Sara!

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.410
Get away from me, you jerk!

00:16:40.620 --> 00:16:42.830
Help... Help us!

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:44.920
Help us, Noa!

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.540
Big sister?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.470
Sara... Tia... Run!

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:00.260
Run away!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.610
Noa!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.860
Sara, Tia... I'm sorry...

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.450
Noa!

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:26.290
How annoying, forcibly taking control like that.

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:35.380
Yui, I'm sorry.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:39.600
You're in this terrible situation
and we couldn't do anything to help.

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:40.720
It's okay.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:45.430
Our big sister Noa was in one of
the huge Regalia Gear at the castle.

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:46.810
Huh?

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:51.480
She should have been swallowed
up by Lux Ex Machina, but...

00:17:56.320 --> 00:17:57.530
Tia?

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:01.120
Were you lonely?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:03.040
Yeah, a little.

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:05.750
But now the two of you are here.

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:12.670
Thank you for coming back... Sara, Tia...

00:18:14.800 --> 00:18:17.380
We'll find a way back to Rena and the others.

00:18:17.590 --> 00:18:18.260
How?

00:18:18.470 --> 00:18:19.970
I can't fly!

00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:22.350
I'm not sure yet, but...

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.560
Oh...

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:26.430
But we can still take action right now!

00:18:26.640 --> 00:18:27.060
Really?

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.560
What can we do?

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:32.230
Eat a hot meal and go to bed!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.860
--What is she talking about?

00:18:34.070 --> 00:18:38.200
Sara, doesn't eating a hot
meal make you feel happy?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.240
Well, it does, but...

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:44.540
And Tia, doesn't it make you
happy to sleep in a nice warm bed?

00:18:44.740 --> 00:18:47.290
Yeah, I love being in bed!

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:52.000
When you're feeling down and you ignore it,
that feeling just gets bigger and bigger.

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:56.920
You've got to fight it off with
happiness before it gets too big!

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:01.710
Plus we'll need some stamina if
we're going to save the others!

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:03.100
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:06.310
Okay, I'm going to make us another hot meal!

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.390
I'll help!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:08.310
Me too!

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:10.480
Let's serve up some mouth-watering morsels!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:11.980
--All right!
--All right!

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:22.030
Yui, are you asleep?

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.450
Not yet.

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.290
What is it, Sara?

00:19:29.750 --> 00:19:34.250
Johann was saying that you and
Rena are in really bad shape.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:40.250
At this rate, you'll end up like Ryu and Lowe.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.800
Oh...

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:46.720
I don't want to lose you two.

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:53.560
Thank you for telling me, Sara.
All right, let's get some sleep.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.830
Yui is fighting, too.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.920
She's waiting for us. She believes in us.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:21.970
So please...

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:35.810
Rena...

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.480
Yui, are you afraid of dying?

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:41.860
Dying?

00:20:42.070 --> 00:20:43.860
I am afraid.

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:48.570
Yesterday I realized how lonely
it feels when you're cut off.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:53.460
I want to go on living here with everyone.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:57.130
I know that there is still something I can do.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.380
Yui...

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:03.090
But I'm scared and I need to be brave...

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.470
So I tried putting on my Empress' clothes!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:11.850
I've made up my mind! I'm going to help you!

00:21:12.060 --> 00:21:14.060
And I'm going to save Noa!

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:16.650
Huh? Can she be saved?

00:21:16.850 --> 00:21:20.230
I think so! She helped us, after all!

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.610
Oh! Then I'm in, too!

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.200
Sara, Tia, thank you!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:30.410
--Huh?
